Subject: [PATCH 149/488] soh: rename func_80AF683C ->
 EnSa_WaitToTriggerSariasSong

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: an actionFunc (assigned in the type-5 branch) that waits for the player to cross z = -2220 outside a cutscene, then sets EVENTCHKINF_LEARNED_SARIAS_SONG and starts the Saria's Song cutscene via EnSa_HandleCutscene.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Sa/z_en_sa.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Sa/z_en_sa.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Sa/z_en_sa.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Sa/z_en_sa.c
