 // Name from zeldaret/oot (was func_80AF6B20): adopted upstream's name for this address; structure verified to match upstream (identifiers and constants differ, upstream having since renamed them) at 0.93. [oot: https://github.com/zeldaret/oot/blob/main/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Sa/z_en_sa.c]
@@ -518,7 +519,7 @@ void EnSa_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
